#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ice Ih, average proton-disordered structure (D2O), space group P6_3/mmc.
# Positions after Kuhs & Lehmann (1983, J. Phys. Chem. 87, 4312): O on 4f, D on 4f and 12k,
# each D site half occupied. Cell after Roettger et al. (1994, Acta Cryst. B 50, 644), 250 K.
# Typed in for the SeaFreeze diffraction tool (no ice Ih entry in the COD ice collection);
# only the c/a ratio and the fractional coordinates are used, the volume comes from SeaFreeze.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
